    "details": "<p><strong>MEDAITHON &rsquo;26 &ndash; Where Code Meets Medicine</strong></p>\n<p>Join <strong>MEDAITHON &rsquo;26</strong>, a 50-hour Healthcare Innovation Hackathon bringing together engineering students and healthcare professionals to solve real-world medical challenges through technology, AI, hardware, and software.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>50-Hour Healthcare Innovation Hackathon</li>\n<li>200+ Hackers | 5 Innovation Tracks</li>\n<li>Engineering + Medical Collaboration</li>\n<li>Prize Pool: ₹1,00,000+</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1st Prize: ₹30,000</li>\n<li>2nd Prize: ₹20,000</li>\n<li>3rd Prize: ₹15,000</li>\n<li>Special Mentions: 7 Teams</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Team Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3 engineering students per team</li>\n<li>At least 1 female member per team</li>\n<li>2 healthcare professionals provided by the organizers</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Abstract Submission:</strong></p>\n<p>Submit a 4-slide Solution Abstract using the official PPT Template v2.0. Upload it to Google Drive and submit the link during registration. Refer to the official Rulebook for complete guidelines.</p>\n<p><strong>Innovate. Collaborate. Transform Healthcare.</strong></p>\n<p>Register now and be part of the future of medical innovation!</p>",
